Why about proposing some sort higher order widgets? Decorator?

```js
var hideOnEmpty = instantsearch.addons.hideOnEmptySearch;
search.addWidget(hideOnEmpty(instantsearch.widgets.searchBox({
    container: '#search-box',
    placeholder: 'Search for products',
    cssClass: 'form-control',
    poweredBy: true
  })
));
```
